        <!-- ============ DECK: SEGUE — ACCESSIBILITY ============ -->
        <section class="block container narrow deck-only" data-notes="Say this as the hinge, not a credential. For Dame: never lead with WCAG/S360 — outcome + autonomy first; standards as receipts, once. Keep the posture humble. Then pivot to THE TURN.">
